// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄

#include <behaviors.dtsi>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/keys.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/pointing.h>
#include "keys_de.h"
#include "keys_nb.h"

#define Base        0
#define Nav         1
#define Sym         2
#define Fun         3
#define Game        4
#define Gameplus    5

&mt {
    quick-tap-ms = <100>;
    global-quick-tap;
    flavor = "tap-preferred";
    tapping-term-ms = <250>;
};

&lt {
    tapping-term-ms = <240>;
    flavor = "balanced";
    quick-tap-ms = <150>;
};

/ {
    behaviors {
        hm: homerow_mods {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HOMEROW_MODS";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            quick-tap-ms = <125>;
            global-quick-tap;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
        };

        LongPress: LongPress {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "LONGPRESS";
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <400>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            hold-trigger-on-release;
        };

        HRShiftR: HRShiftR {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HRSHIFTR";
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            hold-trigger-on-release;
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <0 1 2 3 4 10 11 12 13 14 20 21 22 23 24 25 32 33 34>;
            quick-tap-ms = <125>;
        };

        HRShiftL: HRShiftL {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HRSHIFTL";
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            hold-trigger-on-release;
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <5 6 7 8 9 15 16 17 18 19 26 27 28 29 30 31 35 36 37>;
            quick-tap-ms = <125>;
        };

        HMR: HMR {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HMR";
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            hold-trigger-on-release;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <0 1 2 3 4 10 11 12 13 14 20 21 22 23 24 25 32 33 34>;
            quick-tap-ms = <125>;
        };

        HML: HML {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HML";
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            hold-trigger-on-release;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <5 6 7 8 9 15 16 17 18 19 26 27 28 29 30 31 35 36 37>;
            quick-tap-ms = <125>;
        };

        tlp: tlp {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "TOGGLELAYERPRESS";
            bindings = <&tog>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <350>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
        };
    };

    combos {
        compatible = "zmk,combos";

        caps {
            bindings = <&caps_word>;
            key-positions = <34 35>;
            timeout-ms = <150>;
            layers = <0 2>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
        };

        sqt {
            bindings = <&kp DE_SQT>;
            key-positions = <16 17>;
            timeout-ms = <150>;
            layers = <0 2>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
        };

        minus {
            bindings = <&kp DE_MINUS>;
            key-positions = <13 12>;
            timeout-ms = <150>;
            layers = <0 2>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
        };

        underscore {
            bindings = <&kp DE_UNDERSCORE>;
            key-positions = <2 3>;
            timeout-ms = <150>;
            layers = <0 2>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
        };

        dqt {
            bindings = <&kp DE_DQT>;
            key-positions = <7 6>;
            timeout-ms = <150>;
            layers = <0 2>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
        };

        question {
            bindings = <&kp DE_QUESTION>;
            key-positions = <1 2>;
            timeout-ms = <150>;
            layers = <0 2>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
        };

        excl {
            bindings = <&kp DE_EXCLAMATION>;
            key-positions = <11 12>;
            timeout-ms = <150>;
            layers = <0 2>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
        };

        slash {
            bindings = <&kp DE_SLASH>;
            key-positions = <24 23>;
            timeout-ms = <150>;
            layers = <0 2>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
        };

        backslash {
            bindings = <&kp DE_BACKSLASH>;
            key-positions = <23 22>;
            timeout-ms = <150>;
            layers = <0 2>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
        };

        left_parenthesis {
            bindings = <&kp DE_LEFT_PARENTHESIS>;
            key-positions = <27 28>;
            timeout-ms = <150>;
            layers = <0 2>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
        };

        right_parenthesis {
            bindings = <&kp DE_RIGHT_PARENTHESIS>;
            key-positions = <28 29>;
            timeout-ms = <150>;
            layers = <0 2>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
        };

        and {
            bindings = <&kp DE_AMPERSAND>;
            key-positions = <17 18>;
            timeout-ms = <150>;
            layers = <0 2>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
        };

        pipe {
            bindings = <&kp DE_PIPE>;
            key-positions = <7 8>;
            timeout-ms = <150>;
            layers = <0 2>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
        };

        plus {
            bindings = <&kp DE_PLUS>;
            key-positions = <0 1>;
            timeout-ms = <150>;
            layers = <0 2>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
        };

        equal {
            bindings = <&kp DE_EQUAL>;
            key-positions = <10 11>;
            timeout-ms = <150>;
            layers = <0 2>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
        };

        asterisk {
            bindings = <&kp DE_ASTERISK>;
            key-positions = <21 22>;
            timeout-ms = <150>;
            layers = <0 2>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
        };

        nb_sqt {
            bindings = <&kp NB_SQT>;
            key-positions = <16 17>;
            timeout-ms = <150>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
        };

        nb_dash {
            bindings = <&kp NB_MINUS>;
            key-positions = <13 12>;
            timeout-ms = <150>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
        };

        nb_underscore {
            bindings = <&kp NB_UNDERSCORE>;
            key-positions = <2 3>;
            timeout-ms = <150>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
        };

        nb_dqt {
            bindings = <&kp NB_DQT>;
            key-positions = <7 6>;
            timeout-ms = <150>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
        };

        nb_question {
            bindings = <&kp NB_QMARK>;
            key-positions = <1 2>;
            timeout-ms = <150>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
        };

        nb_excl {
            bindings = <&kp NB_EXCL>;
            key-positions = <11 12>;
            timeout-ms = <150>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
        };

        nb_slash {
            bindings = <&kp NB_SLASH>;
            key-positions = <24 23>;
            timeout-ms = <150>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
        };

        nb_backslash {
            bindings = <&kp NB_BSLH>;
            key-positions = <23 22>;
            timeout-ms = <150>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
        };

        nb_left_parenthesis {
            bindings = <&kp NB_LEFT_PARENTHESIS>;
            key-positions = <27 28>;
            timeout-ms = <150>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
        };

        nb_right_parenthesis {
            bindings = <&kp NB_RIGHT_PARENTHESIS>;
            key-positions = <28 29>;
            timeout-ms = <150>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
        };

        nb_and {
            bindings = <&kp NB_AMPERSAND>;
            key-positions = <17 18>;
            timeout-ms = <150>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
        };

        nb_pipe {
            bindings = <&kp NB_PIPE>;
            key-positions = <7 8>;
            timeout-ms = <150>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
        };

        nb_plus {
            bindings = <&kp NB_PLUS>;
            key-positions = <0 1>;
            timeout-ms = <150>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
        };

        nb_equal {
            bindings = <&kp NB_EQUAL>;
            key-positions = <10 11>;
            timeout-ms = <150>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
        };

        nb_asterisk {
            bindings = <&kp NB_ASTERISK>;
            key-positions = <21 22>;
            timeout-ms = <150>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
        };
    };

    keymap {
        compatible = "zmk,keymap";

        KAY {
            display-name = "KAY";
            bindings = <
                 &kp DE_K        &kp DE_PERIOD   &kp DE_A         &kp DE_COMMA           &kp DE_Y           &kp DE_P   &kp DE_D              &kp DE_L         &kp DE_M           &kp DE_J
                 &HML LGUI DE_H  &HML LALT DE_O  &HML LCTRL DE_E  &HRShiftL LSHIFT DE_I  &kp DE_U           &kp DE_G   &HRShiftR RSHFT DE_T  &HMR RCTRL DE_R  &HMR RALT DE_N     &HMR RGUI DE_S
&mt ESCAPE DE_X  &kp DE_Z        &kp DE_Q        &kp DE_A_UMLAUT  &kp DE_U_UMLAUT        &kp DE_O_UMLAUT    &kp DE_B   &mt LC(DE_C) DE_C     &kp DE_W         &mt LC(DE_V) DE_V  &kp DE_F        &kp DE_ESZETT
                                                 &tlp 6 LEFT_GUI  &lt 4 TAB              &kp DE_SPACE       &kp ENTER  &lt 1 BSPC            &lt 5 DELETE
            >;
        };

        KAY+ {
            bindings = <
            &kp DE_DEGREE  &kp DE_EURO      &kp DOLLAR      &kp DE_SLASH      &kp DE_BACKSLASH       &kp DE_AMPS           &kp DE_PERCENT  &kp DE_LEFT_BRACKET      &kp DE_RIGHT_BRACKET      &kp DE_ACUTE
            &kp DE_CARET   &kp DE_QUESTION  &kp DE_EXCL     &kp DE_MINUS      &kp DE_UNDER           &kp DE_DOUBLE_QUOTES  &kp DE_SQT      &kp DE_LEFT_PARENTHESIS  &kp DE_RIGHT_PARENTHESIS  &kp DE_GRAVE
&kp ESCAPE  &kp DE_PIPE    &kp DE_AT        &kp DE_SECTION  &kp DE_LESS_THAN  &kp DE_GREATER_THAN    &kp DE_ASTRK          &kp DE_HASH     &kp DE_LEFT_BRACE        &kp DE_RIGHT_BRACE        &kp DE_TILDE  &none
                                            &trans          &trans            &trans                 &trans                &trans          &trans
            >;

            label = "KAY+";
        };

        NORSK {
            display-name = "NORSK";
            bindings = <
                 &kp NB_K        &kp NB_PERIOD   &kp NB_A         &kp NB_COMMA           &kp NB_Y         &kp NB_P  &kp NB_D              &kp NB_L         &kp NB_M           &kp NB_J
                 &HML LGUI NB_H  &HML LALT NB_O  &HML LCTRL NB_E  &HRShiftL LSHIFT NB_I  &kp NB_U         &kp NB_G  &HRShiftR RSHFT NB_T  &HMR RCTRL NB_R  &HMR RALT NB_N     &HMR RGUI NB_S
&mt ESCAPE NB_X  &kp NB_Z        &kp NB_Q        &kp NB_AE        &kp NB_O_SLASH         &kp NB_A_RING    &kp NB_B  &mt LC(NB_C) NB_C     &kp NB_W         &mt LC(NB_V) NB_V  &kp NB_F        &to 0
                                                 &trans           &trans                 &trans           &trans    &lt 3 BSPC            &trans
            >;
        };

        NORSK+ {
            label = "NORSK+";
            bindings = <
            &kp DE_DEGREE  &kp NB_EURO      &kp NB_DOLLAR   &kp NB_SLASH  &kp NB_BACKSLASH    &kp NB_AMPS           &kp NB_PERCENT  &kp NB_LEFT_BRACKET      &kp NB_RIGHT_BRACKET      &kp NB_ACUTE
            &kp NB_CARET   &kp NB_QUESTION  &kp DE_EXCL     &kp NB_MINUS  &kp NB_UNDER        &kp NB_DOUBLE_QUOTES  &kp NB_SQT      &kp NB_LEFT_PARENTHESIS  &kp NB_RIGHT_PARENTHESIS  &kp NB_GRAVE
&kp ESCAPE  &kp NB_PIPE    &kp NB_AT        &kp NB_SECTION  &kp NB_LT     &kp NB_GT           &kp NB_ASTERISK       &kp NB_HASH     &kp NB_LEFT_BRACE        &kp NB_RIGHT_BRACE        &kp NB_TILDE  &to 0
                                            &trans          &trans        &trans              &trans                &trans          &trans
            >;
        };

        NUMBER {
            display-name = "NUMBER";
            bindings = <
                &kp DE_ASTERISK  &kp DE_N7  &kp DE_N8  &kp DE_N9  &kp DE_MINUS    &kp DE_SUPER2  &kp DE_LESS_THAN  &kp UP_ARROW    &kp DE_GREATER_THAN  &none
                &kp DE_SLASH     &kp DE_N4  &kp DE_N5  &kp DE_N6  &kp DE_PLUS     &kp DE_SUPER3  &kp LEFT_ARROW    &kp DOWN_ARROW  &kp RIGHT_ARROW      &none
&kp LEFT_SHIFT  &kp DE_N0        &kp DE_N1  &kp DE_N2  &kp DE_N3  &kp DE_EQUAL    &none          &none             &kp DE_COMMA    &kp DE_PERIOD        &none  &none
                                            &trans     &trans     &trans          &trans         &lt 1 BACKSPACE   &trans
            >;
        };

        EXTRA {
            display-name = "EXTRA";
            bindings = <
        &kp F2  &kp F3  &kp F4           &kp F5    &kp F6           &kp F7  &kp F8            &kp F9            &kp F10             &kp F11
        &none   &none   &kp PAUSE_BREAK  &kp HOME  &kp PAGE_UP      &none   &kp LC(LS(DE_T))  &kp LG(LS(DE_S))  &kp LC(LS(ESCAPE))  &none
&kp F1  &none   &none   &none            &kp END   &kp PAGE_DOWN    &none   &none             &none             &kp LC(LA(DELETE))  &none    &kp F12
                        &trans           &trans    &trans           &trans  &trans            &trans
            >;
        };

        Nav {
            display-name = "Nav";
            bindings = <
       &bootloader  &studio_unlock  &none      &msc SCRL_UP    &to 7       &none     &msc SCRL_LEFT  &mmv MOVE_UP    &msc SCRL_RIGHT  &none
       &none        &mkp MCLK       &mkp RCLK  &mkp LCLK       &mkp MB4    &mkp MB5  &mmv MOVE_LEFT  &mmv MOVE_DOWN  &mmv MOVE_RIGHT  &none
&none  &to 0        &to 9           &to 2      &msc SCRL_DOWN  &none       &none     &none           &none           &none            &none  &none
                                    &trans     &trans          &trans      &trans    &trans          &trans
            >;
        };

        GAME {
            display-name = "Game";
            bindings = <
         &kp DE_Y        &kp DE_X  &kp DE_C   &kp DE_V      &sl 8       &none      &none           &kp UP_ARROW    &none            &kp LS(TAB)
         &kp DE_G        &kp DE_Q  &kp DE_W   &kp DE_E      &kp DE_R    &none      &kp LEFT_ARROW  &kp DOWN_ARROW  &kp RIGHT_ARROW  &none
&kp ESC  &kp LEFT_SHIFT  &kp DE_A  &kp DE_S   &kp DE_D      &kp DE_F    &none      &none           &none           &none            &none        &kp TAB
                                   &kp LCTRL  &kp LEFT_ALT  &trans      &kp ENTER  &trans          &kp LEFT_GUI
            >;
        };

        GAME+ {
            display-name = "Game+";
            bindings = <
         &kp DE_N1  &kp DE_N2  &kp DE_N3  &kp DE_N4  &kp DE_N5    &kp DE_Z  &kp DE_U  &kp DE_I  &kp DE_O  &kp DE_P
         &kp DE_N6  &kp DE_N7  &trans     &kp DE_N8  &kp DE_N9    &kp DE_H  &kp DE_J  &kp DE_K  &kp DE_L  &kp F12
&kp TAB  &to 0      &trans     &trans     &trans     &kp DE_N0    &kp DE_N  &kp DE_M  &kp F5    &kp F3    &to 9     &kp LA(F4)
                               &trans     &trans     &trans       &trans    &trans    &trans
            >;
        };

        MMO {
            bindings = <
                     &kp DE_V  &kp DE_Q  &kp DE_W   &kp DE_E        &kp DE_R    &kp DE_U  &kp DE_I  &kp LS(DE_H)  &kp LC(LA(LS(DE_T)))  &trans
                     &kp TAB   &kp DE_A  &kp DE_S   &kp DE_D        &kp DE_F    &kp DE_G  &kp DE_H  &trans        &trans                &trans
&mt ESCAPE DE_CARET  &kp DE_N  &kp DE_Y  &kp DE_X   &kp DE_C        &kp DE_V    &kp DE_Z  &kp DE_O  &trans        &to 0                 &to 7   &trans
                                         &kp LCTRL  &kp LEFT_SHIFT  &trans      &trans    &trans    &kp LEFT_GUI
            >;

            label = "MMO";
        };
    };
};
